Z||000000||danny boy||01-10-2001||09:59 PM|||| Does anyone know the size in CC's of factory injectors in an 85 2.8? I have six 360cc injectors from another project,and was wondering if they would be usable in my fiero.||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||01-11-2001||12:30 AM||||You'll have to convert from 15.9 lbs/hr. Also, you will need to know the time that 360cc was measured over.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jhonny||01-11-2001||08:19 AM||||Hi,<P>You can use these conversion formulas<P>cc per minute = lbs per hour x 10.2<BR>or<BR>lbs per hour = cc per minute / 10.2<P>cc = cubic centimeters per minute<P>See also <A HREF="http://www.autospeed.com/A_0102/P_2/article.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.autospeed.com/A_0102/P_2/article.html</A> <P>/// Jhonny<P>------------------<BR>Jhonny Sokura<BR>Vadstena, Östergötland Sweden<BR><A HREF="http://www.vadstena.se/turism/engelsk/index.html" TARGET=_blank> Welcome to Vadstena</A><P>Pontiac Fiero GT -87 , V6 5spd<p>[This message has been edited by Jhonny (edited 01-11-2001).]||||reg||1
